{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"730","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Bulmart"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A new trade empire is rising in Berland. Bulmart, an emerging trade giant, decided to dominate the market of ... shovels! And now almost every city in Berland has a Bulmart store, and some cities even have several of them! The only problem is, at the moment sales are ... let's say a little below estimates. Some people even say that shovels retail market is too small for such a big company to make a profit. But the company management believes in the future of that market and seeks new ways to increase income. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cities in Berland connected with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" bi-directional roads. All roads have equal lengths. It can happen that it is impossible to reach a city from another city using only roads. There is no road which connects a city to itself. Any pair of cities can be connected by at most one road."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"w"},{"kind":"text","text":" Bulmart stores in Berland. Each of them is described by three numbers: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of city where the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th store is located (a city can have no stores at all or have several of them), "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of shovels in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th store, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the price of a single shovel in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th store (in burles). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The latest idea of the Bulmart management is to create a program which will help customers get shovels as fast as possible for affordable budget. Formally, the program has to find the minimum amount of time needed to deliver "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"rj"},{"kind":"text","text":" shovels to the customer in the city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"gj"},{"kind":"text","text":" for the total cost of no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles. The delivery time between any two adjacent cities is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":". If shovels are delivered from several cities, the delivery time is equal to the arrival time of the last package. The delivery itself is free of charge."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The program needs to find answers to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" such queries. Each query has to be processed independently from others, i.e. a query does not change number of shovels in stores for the next queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 5000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ m ≤ min(5000, n·(n - 1) / 2))"},{"kind":"text","text":". Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xe"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ye"},{"kind":"text","text":", meaning that the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"e"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th road connects cities "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xe"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ye"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ xe, ye ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"w"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ w ≤ 5000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the total number of Bulmart stores in Berland. Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"w"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains three integers describing the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th store: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci, ki, pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci ≤ n, 1 ≤ ki, pi ≤ 2·105"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of queries. Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains three integers describing the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th query: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"gj, rj"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ gj ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ rj, aj ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines. On the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line, print an answer for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th query — the minimum amount of time needed to deliver "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"rj"},{"kind":"text","text":" shovels to the customer in city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"gj"},{"kind":"text","text":" spending no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles. Print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there is no solution for the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 4\n4 2\n5 4\n1 2\n3 2\n2\n4 1 2\n3 2 3\n6\n1 2 6\n2 3 7\n3 1 2\n4 3 8\n5 2 5\n6 1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n-1\n2\n2\n3\n-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"730C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/730/problem/C"}